Math problems on LeetCode have a reputation for being either
trivially easy or completely unapproachable.

The unapproachable ones usually come down to one of these:
you do not know modular inverse, you forgot how fast power works,
or you never learned the Sieve of Eratosthenes.

None of these are hard. They just require knowing the formula.

This post is that formula sheet.
Everything in one place, with C++ code ready to use.

